 after your untimely demise. Send adventurers into battle, sell what they find, and build up your town!","steam_appid":3226210,"support_info":{"email":"adam@skeleseller.com","url":"https://skeleseller.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://skeleseller.com/"}